#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:1
msgid "_validate_fit_method"
msgstr "_validate_fit_method"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:3
msgid "Firma"
msgstr "Signature"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:9
msgid "Che problema risolve"
msgstr "What a problem it solves"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:11
msgid ""
"Valida il modello di incertezza richiesto da `lin_fit` e restringe il "
"tipo di ritorno al literal interno `FitMethod`."
msgstr ""
"Validates the uncertainty model required by `lin_fit` and restricts the "
"return type to the internal literal `FitMethod`."

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:13
msgid "Contratto sugli input"
msgstr "Input contract"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:15
msgid "`fit_method=\"absolute\"` usa le incertezze assolute fornite dall'utente."
msgstr "`fit_method=\"absolute\"` uses user-supplied absolute uncertainties."

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:16
msgid "`fit_method=\"residual\"` stima dai residui un fattore globale di scala."
msgstr ""
"`fit_method=\"residual\"` estimates a global scaling factor from the "
"residuals."

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:17
msgid "Qualunque altro valore viene rifiutato."
msgstr "Any other value is rejected."

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:19
msgid "Dove viene usata"
msgstr "Where it is used"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:21
msgid ""
"in [`lin_fit`](../../moduli/fit_utils/lin-fit.md), prima di scegliere il "
"ramo di calcolo"
msgstr ""
"in [`lin_fit`](../../moduli/fit_utils/lin-fit.md), before choosing the "
"calculation branch"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:23
msgid "Come fallisce"
msgstr "How it fails"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:25
msgid "`ValueError` se il valore non e `\"absolute\"` oppure `\"residual\"`"
msgstr "`ValueError` if the value is not `\"absolute\"` or `\"residual\"`"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:27
msgid "Perche resta privata"
msgstr "Because it remains private"

#: ../../source/checks/fit_utils/validate-fit-method.md:29
msgid ""
"Formalizza una scelta interna gia esposta dal parametro pubblico "
"`fit_method`, senza introdurre un secondo punto di ingresso nell'API."
msgstr ""
"It formalizes an internal choice already exposed by the public parameter "
"`fit_method`, without introducing a second entry point into the API."
